{"id": "rugby-tour-v-bratislave-so-zilinou-proti-cyprus-limassol-crusaders", "source": "archiv", "date": "2022-05-15T12:53:50", "title": "Muži: Limassol Crusaders z Cypru v Bratislave (máj 2022)", "excerpt": "Prehra 20 : 35 po tvrdom boji a veľká skúsenosť – za výber nastúpilo päť hráčov zo Žiliny.", "thumb": "assets/archive/rugby-tour-v-bratislave-so-zilinou-proti-cyprus-limassol-crusaders/021.jpg", "category": "muzi", "html": "<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"background-color:#e3ebe4;padding-top:20px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:24px\">\n<p><strong>Kedy:</strong> máj 2022<br><strong>Kde:</strong> Bratislava<br><strong>Výsledok:</strong> 20 : 35 pre Limassol Crusaders</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>Sretli sme sa v Bratislave s tímom Limassol Crussanders z Cypru. Bolo to velké stretnutie tímov. Prehrali sme po tvrdom boli 20-35 ale bola to velká skúsenost pre slovenskych hráčov. Zo Žiliny hralo 5 Hráčov: Lukáš Birciak (SK), Lukáš Spurny (CZ), Martin Bardun (SK), Alexandar Stevanovič (SRB), Tato Oqoromelidze (Gruz). Po zápase bol vynikajùci tretí polčas. Dakujeme Rugby klubu bratislava za pozvanie a tešíme sa na dalšie spoločné stretnutia, Bolo nám cťou. </p>\n\n<p>We meet In Bratislava team Limassol Crussanders Cyprus. It was great team meeting . We lost after hard fight 20-35 but it was great experience for Slovak players. From Zilina was playing 5 players, Lukas Birciak (SK), Lukas Spurny (CZ), Martin Bardun(SK), Alexandar Stevanovic (SRB), Tato Oqoromelidze(Gruz). After match was awesome third halftime. thanx rugby klub Bratislava for inviting us and we are looking for next together events. It was pleasure for us.</p>\n\n<p> Lukas Birciak</p>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Fotky</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"assets/archive/rugby-tour-v-bratislave-so-zilinou-proti-cyprus-limassol-crusaders/001.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n<figure